---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { CATEGORIES } from '../data/categories';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Micro Signal Cosmos"
  description="Learn about Micro Signal Cosmos, our editorial mission, vision, and our commitment to clear, verified science, technology, and AI journalism."
  canonical="https://microsignalcosmos.com/about/"
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="bg-[#F7F9FC] py-12 sm:py-20">
    <div class="container-main">

      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#697586]">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#14233B]">Home</a>
          </li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-300">/</li>
          <li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-[#14233B]">About Us</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#14233B] uppercase">
            About the Publication
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#14233B] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Discover More.
          <span class="mt-2 block text-[#3478F6]">
            Understand Better.
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4B5565] sm:text-lg">
          Micro Signal Cosmos is an independent digital publication exploring the frontiers of science, computing, artificial intelligence, and human innovation. We translate complex breakthroughs into clear, grounded, and accessible knowledge.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Mission Card -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3478F6] uppercase">
          Our Editorial Philosophy
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B] sm:text-3xl">
          Finding the Signal in a Universe of Noise
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4B5565]">
          <p>
            In today's fast-moving digital ecosystem, information is ubiquitous, but genuine comprehension is rare. Daily feeds are flooded with sensational headlines, hype-driven narratives, and jargon-heavy abstracts that leave readers more perplexed than enlightened.
          </p>

          <p>
            The name <strong class="font-semibold text-[#14233B]">Micro Signal Cosmos</strong> reflects our core metaphor: just as radio astronomers filter electromagnetic static to detect faint, revealing micro-signals from distant corners of the cosmos, our editorial desk filters through digital noise to isolate the foundational scientific and technological breakthroughs that genuinely shape human destiny.
          </p>

          <p>
            Whether dissecting how attention mechanisms operate inside modern transformer models, investigating planetary probes studying interstellar space, or charting the architectural shifts in decentralized computing, our mission remains steadfast: to empower curious minds to explore without intimidation and understand with lasting confidence.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl">
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3478F6] uppercase">
            Curated Knowledge Streams
          </p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B] sm:text-3xl">
            Our Core Coverage Pillars
          </h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm text-[#697586]">
            Carefully structured verticals designed for lifelong learners, research engineers, software developers, and technology enthusiasts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          {CATEGORIES.map((cat, index) => (
            <a
              href={cat.href}
              class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:shadow-md"
            >
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#F7F9FC] text-sm font-bold text-[#14233B] group-hover:border-[#3478F6]/30 group-hover:bg-[#3478F6]/10 group-hover:text-[#3478F6]">
                    {cat.icon}
                  </span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#9AA4B2] uppercase">
                    Pillar 0{index + 1}
                  </span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-[#14233B] group-hover:text-[#3478F6]">
                  {cat.name}
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#697586]">
                  {cat.description}
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#3478F6]">
                <span>Explore stream</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Editorial Values -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-5xl border-t border-[#E3E8EF] pt-16">
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3478F6] uppercase">
            Commitment to Quality
          </p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#14233B] sm:text-3xl">
            Our Editorial Standards
          </h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm text-[#697586]">
            Every published dispatch adheres to rigorous editorial integrity and verification principles.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-7 shadow-xs">
            <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]/10 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#3478F6]">01</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#14233B]">Accuracy & Primary Sourcing</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#697586]">
              We prioritize peer-reviewed research papers, official technical documentation, and primary engineering disclosures over second-hand reports.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-7 shadow-xs">
            <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]/10 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#3478F6]">02</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#14233B]">Clarity Without Hype</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#697586]">
              We reject clickbait and exaggerated claims. We outline real-world capabilities alongside technical limitations and security considerations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-7 shadow-xs">
            <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]/10 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#3478F6]">03</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-[#14233B]">Respect for the Reader</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#697586]">
              Your attention is valuable. Our articles feature clean 18px reading typography, clear structural headings, and zero intrusive popups or layout shifts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy Quick Access Grid -->
        <div class="mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#EEF1F5]/60 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#14233B]">Editorial Transparency & Governance</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#697586]">
            Review our formal standards, verification guidelines, and governance framework:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:bg-slate-50">
              <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B]">Editorial Policy &rarr;</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] text-[#697586]">Research standards & sourcing criteria</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/fact-checking-policy/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:bg-slate-50">
              <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B]">Fact-checking &rarr;</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] text-[#697586]">Verification protocols & claims review</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/corrections-policy/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:bg-slate-50">
              <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B]">Corrections &rarr;</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] text-[#697586]">How we log and update errors</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/authors/" class="rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-4 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#3478F6] hover:bg-slate-50">
              <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#14233B]">Editorial Team &rarr;</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-[11px] text-[#697586]">Staff directory & author credentials</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Banner -->
        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs sm:p-8">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#14233B]">Have feedback or a research proposal?</h4>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#697586]">We welcome thoughtful story pitches, technical inquiries, and academic feedback.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <a
              href="/contact/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#3478F6] px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-xs transition-colors hover:bg-[#2563EB]"
            >
              Contact Editorial Desk
            </a>
            <a
              href="/articles/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#14233B] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50"
            >
              Browse Articles
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
